  "description": "The MASTER 2.0 chopper-style stretch cruiser bike is a perfect pick for guys who like a fun and adventurous ride. The unique style encompasses an ergonomic sear, long-tube oversized frame, high-rise handlebars, dual suspension and luxury matte coating for fun and fulfilling cruising. The internal 3-speed transmission with a reliable front hub brake makes this bicycle ideal for swiftly switching between various speeds while maintaining exceptional stability.\n\n20“ MASTER20 DS\n\n20\" Low Rider Stretch Cruiser Bike 2022-03\n\nSIZES\n\n11“\n\nCOLORS\n\nMatte Black, Matte Gary\n\nFRAME\n\nTracer Stretch Hi-ten Steel\n\nFORK\n\nTracer Dual Suspension Classical Spring\n\nSHOCK\n\nN/A\n\nHANDLEBAR\n\nTracer Steel Hi-Ris-Type 13\" 280mm\n\nSTEM\n\nAlloy 28.6mmx22.2mm Heavy Duty\n\nHEADSET\n\nSteel Diameter 1-1/8x30xH34mm\n\nSEATPOST\n\nSteel 28.6x300mm\n\nSADDLE\n\nVacuum elastic PVC leather+high density PU foam with springs\n\nBOTTOM BRACKET\n\nSteel Crankset\n\nRIMS\n\nFat Alloy Wide front 60mm Rear 80mm 20”*36H*14G Spoke wheelset\n\nFRONT HUB\n\nAlloy Disc 3/8”x14Gx36H 110x150mm\n\nREAR HUB\n\nSTURMEY ARCHER SX RK3 3-Speed Disc Brake\n\nSPOKES\n\nSteel 14G\n\nTIRES\n\nFat Black white wall 20'' x 3.0\n\nFENDERS\n\nN/A\n\nEXTRAS\n\nChopper Stretch Bike\n\nWEIGHT\n\nThe most accurate way to determine any bike’s weight is to have your local dealer weigh it for you. Many brands strive to list the lowest possible weight, but in reality weight can vary based on size, finish, hardware and accessories. All our bikes are designed for best-in-class weight and ride quality.",
